{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This novel by Jules Verne, often called his lost novel, was written in 1863 and published for the first time in 1994. It tells the story of a young man who lives in a highly technologically advanced world.","Paris in the 20th Century"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"literature\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
