{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["While a doctoral student, T. S. Eliot studied Buddhism and Indic philology, learning Sanskrit and Pāli to read the religious texts. What languages did Eliot study/learn in prep school and college?","Latin, Greek, French, and German"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"literature\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
